        "node_id": "n_1_e0b8ba",
        "thought_text": "I need to refine the reasoning step to avoid the observed error. The current implementation doesn't correctly track the marker's path and doesn't properly check for matches at each step. I should modify the simulation to move the marker step by step, updating the position and time at each step, and checking for matches against the target drawing. This will ensure that we correctly identify the earliest and latest times the marker can dry out while still achieving the target drawing.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_1_e0b8ba_0",
